        <mxCell id="foot" value="&lt;b&gt;From Prometheus on mk4&lt;/b&gt; (evidence/prometheus.txt): the web container's CPU from cAdvisor, matched to each pod's start time, and istio_requests_total for the public Service. At the busiest minute, with 4.8 requests per second for the whole site, the busiest pod used 0.26 cores." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
